<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest cuts oil services cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest cuts oil services cos.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it downgraded eight oil services stocks based on a more cautious outlook for the group.</p>
<p>-- Cut Baker Hughes Inc, BJ Services Co, Halliburton Co, Ensco International Inc and Global Marine to hold from buy.  </p>
<p>-- Also cut Noble Drilling Corp and Rowan Cos Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- Cut Weatherford Enterra Inc to accumulate from buy.</p>
</text>
